            title: 'Five Up Dominoes',
            subtitle: 'Domino',
            content: [
              {
                type: 'paragraph',
                text: 'Domino game in the Fives family. All doubles are spinners. Score when layout pip total is a multiple of 5. Play to 61 points.',
              },
              {
                type: 'paragraph',
                text: 'Five Up is a domino game in the Fives family. Dominic C. Armanino made it extremely popular in California and the Southwestern United States with books and tournaments.',
              },
            ],
          },
          {
            title: 'Setup',
            subtitle: 'Table, deck, equipment, and deal',
